  "releaseNotes": "Refactor CSV handling and implement task management\n\n   - Moved CSV-related classes to `SharpBoxesCore.Office.CSV` namespace for better organization.\n   - Updated `CsvOprHelper` methods to reflect the new structure.\n   - Added `AddOrUpdate` and `TryRemove` methods to the `Helpers` class.\n   - Introduced `PathHelper` class for file path manipulation.\n   - Added `ExcelExporter` and `IExcelExporter` classes for Excel file operations using `MiniExcel`.\n   - Implemented a new task management system with `BackgroundTaskManager`, `ThreadPoolManager`, and `TaskDefinition`.\n   - Encapsulated logging functionality in `ILogger` and `ConsoleLogger`.\n   - Updated project file for NuGet package generation and added global using directives.\n   - Enhanced overall functionality and maintainability with new classes and interfaces.",
